<view class="notice list-tip">只展示本店在岗/休息中的服务人员，用于核对订单是谁做的；电话与证件不在代理侧展示。</view>

<view class="error" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>

<view class="list" wx:if="{{list.length}}">
  <view class="card item" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="who">
        <image class="avatar" wx:if="{{item.avatar}}" src="{{item.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view class="avatar avatar-empty" wx:else>{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="who-text">
          <view class="row">
            <text class="item-title">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="tag {{item.statusTone}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="muted">{{item.ratingText}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="row bottom">
      <text class="muted">{{item.orderText}}</text>
      <text class="muted">{{item.cityText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted footer" wx:if="{{finished}}">共 {{total}} 人，已全部加载</view>
  <view class="muted footer" wx:else>上拉加载更多</view>
</view>

<view class="empty" wx:elif="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view>
<view class="empty" wx:else>本店暂无在岗服务人员。</view>
